{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38294","headline":"褭娜 · 韩偓","name":"褭娜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"褭娜腰肢澹薄妆，六朝宫样窄衣裳。\n着词暂见樱桃破，飞醆遥闻荳蔻香。\n春恼情怀身觉瘦，酒添颜色粉生光。\n此时不敢分明道，风月应知暗断肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38294.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38294","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}